  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSSF-Iraq_Livelihoods_Programme_Enhance sustainable employment opportunities for individuals in the Kurdistan Region of Iraq (KRI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will create sustainable employment opportunities for 260 individuals across KRI, through a skill building, job placement and learning on the job scheme; accompanied by monitoring and research,  with evidence-based recommendations for the UK Government to effectively scale up this programme.</narrative>
  </description>
